    "summary": "1 CP, used in your Movement phase as one of your MUTANT units that is INFANTRY or MOUNTED is picked to make an Advance move or a Fall Back move; that unit is the target. In a turn when it made that move, the move leaves it still able to start an action. The Stratagem's phase is also given as the Shooting phase, which does not match the Movement phase timing it states.",
